(PUBLIC WORKS DEPARTMENT — Tender EE/ELE/65/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This specification covers internal electrification including wiring,) Tj T*
(distribution boards and earthing complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART C — INTERNAL WIRING AND EARTHING) Tj T*
(\(a\) Wiring shall be carried out as per IS 732:2019.) Tj T*
(\(b\) The supply system shall be TN-S earthing arrangement.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Wiring shall be concealed in rigid PVC conduits of 1.5mm wall thickness.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Wires shall be FR PVC insulated, single core, stranded copper conductor of) Tj T*
(450/750 V grade conforming to IS 694:2010.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Lighting circuits shall be wired with 1.5 mm² and power circuits with 4 mm²) Tj T*
(copper conductors.) Tj T*
(\(f\) Miniature circuit breakers shall conform to IS/IEC 60898-1 and shall have a) Tj T*
(breaking capacity of 10 kA.) Tj T*
(\(g\) MCB ratings shall range from 6 A to 32 A as shown in the single line) Tj T*
(diagram.) Tj T*
(\(h\) RCCBs with rated residual operating current of 30 mA shall be provided for) Tj T*
(all socket outlet circuits and shall conform to IS 12640 \(Part 1\). Distribution) Tj T*
(boards and enclosures shall be of suitable size.) Tj T*
(\(i\) Earthing shall be carried out in accordance with IS 3043:2018.) Tj T*
(\(j\) Two numbers of pipe earth electrodes shall be provided for the main) Tj T*
(distribution board.) Tj T*
(\(k\) The earth resistance shall not exceed 1 ohm.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: TESTING, INSPECTION AND CERTIFICATION) Tj T*
(\(a\) Wires shall be tested in accordance with IS 10810. On completion, insulation) Tj T*
(resistance and earth continuity tests shall be carried out in accordance with IS) Tj T*
(732.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Wires, MCBs and RCCBs shall be ISI marked. The equipment shall be inspected) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 4) Tj T*
